<!--Post: 10642--><!--Time: 1110075176-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10642"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 05, 2005 - 6:12 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><a href="http://thekansan.com/stories/012805/localnews_0128050047.shtml" target=_top>http://thekansan.com/stories/012805/localnews_0128 050047.shtml</a> <BR>here&#39;s one<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10642-->
<!--Post: 10749--><!--Time: 1110184273-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10749"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nightdriver<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nightdriver<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 12:31 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hello, victimology has the final say here? We don&#39;t know if he ever acted impulsively, but being a &#34;good&#34; church going guy, maybe, just maybe he did a working woman once in a while. He would probably be the first say he was doing God&#39;s will. Otherwise, a lot of similarities. Even if he didn&#39;t do most of these, some good digging by all of us may come up with a string that could be connected to someone else. The more that are closed, the clearer the remaining dots become.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10749-->
<!--Post: 10835--><!--Time: 1110248165-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10835"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:embersageblue@aol.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 07, 2005 - 6:16 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks Night driver, that is what I have be working on, some cases fit each other some fit Raders mo, just trying to sort it all out right now. Mrs. Hayes was found in similar location as others, so I am trying to connect the dots.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 10835-->
<!--Post: 11918--><!--Time: 1111411285-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11918"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Zenith<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Zenith<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 21, 2005 - 5:21 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Gee Embersage, <BR>Seems lately everywhere I check on the board, you&#39;re writing about 50% of the comments. Appreciate your interest in the case, but don&#39;t you think that&#39;s a little excessive? <BR> <BR>Maybe it doesn&#39;t matter, but I thought I&#39;d mention that it&#39;s really obvious and may or may not be a problem for other posters.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 11918-->
<!--Post: 11930--><!--Time: 1111438175-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11930"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, March 21, 2005 - 12:49 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Emb - just want you to know I really enjoy your posts.....don&#39;t stop now!  I don&#39;t post alot but I DO read constantly..... <BR>Zenith....is that excessive tooooooooooo? <BR> <BR>Hey Z - I enjoy YOUR posts too... <BR><IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
